{"id": "De7Fx7sPof8", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"STARTUP\" to get Mirofish and test your Business Idea. \n\nYou can now test your startup idea before you build a single thing.\n\nIt's called MiroFish, an open source simulation engine.\n\nIt has already crossed 80K stars on GitHub.\n\nFirst, you upload your product idea, pitch or a rough MVP.\n\nThen it builds an entire digital world full of simulated AI people.\n\nEach one has its own personality, background and opinions.\n\nNext, it drops them onto a social media platform.\n\nThey react, argue and talk it out with each other.\n\nIt's like a focus group that runs on its own.\n\nWhen it's done, it writes you a full report.\n\nIt tells you why they loved it.\n\nIt also tells you why they hated it.\n\nAnd it shows what they'd want changed.\n\nPlus you can chat with any one of them individually.\n\nSo you can ask exactly why they felt that way.\n\nIt's like getting customer feedback before you spend a dollar.\n\n#mirofish #businessidea #startup #githubrepo #aiagents", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792944223, "like_count": 1502, "comment_count": 1547, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1808281723783141a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.778, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP-QBsWZVmGHTkC2oEyrUKDa1NLXoXFJqdc87pVx1m2fDCS2ZNqQIXJ1lwqbBWBaIu9RicovybvpTqIZ2rnF1DzkdfQp4LIxDHKLx0.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdqA0b74Qdsdu6WVB5Odv929bJuP9Otc_6XR5sSFwkTVCqe6AGBLPYjHTqjQ7Zd5Nww&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=VBVOucaqmrMQ7kNvwH5C_OX&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=zv3dPM24sbcxBhAWeHcrVg&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRnqX6x9E28UQa7_0lVs-O4eYdNyG6QuuXZcOr4-EJo9A&oe=6AE5F966", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash